      },
      "width": 720,
      "height": 380,
      "data": {
        "title": "Examples",
        "body": "The linked example is a separate graph. Inspect its relevant nodes and relationships; this specification does not embed or execute the example.\n\nA ring and a diamond, on the borders of three cards joined by edges: one card wears a plain disc, one the ring and one the diamond. Each card connects the same way whatever it wears.",
